/* 정보 창 칸 높이 고정 (사용자 2026-11-18 "간격 크기가 계속 달라지는데 고정되게"). 던전마다 글 길이와 줄 수가 달라도 칸 자리가 같게 */
.wm-dungeon-entrance--night .wm-dungeon-entrance__summary {
    height: 150px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.wm-dungeon-entrance--night .wm-dungeon-entrance__description {
    max-height: 60px;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.wm-dungeon-entrance--night .wm-dungeon-entrance__section--foes {
    height: 150px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.wm-dungeon-entrance--night .wm-dungeon-entrance__section--constraints {
    height: 128px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.wm-dungeon-entrance--night .wm-dungeon-entrance__section--run {
    height: 118px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
}
